IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
    PROGRAM-ID. PAYROL00.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
    INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
    FILE-CONTROL.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    77 WS-WHO           PIC X(15).
    77 WS-WHERE         PIC X(20).
    77 WS-WHY           PIC X(30).
    77 WS-RATE          PIC 9(3).
    77 WS-HOURS         PIC 9(3).
    77 WS-GROSS-PAY     PIC 9(9).
    77 WS-GS-PAY-E      PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9. 

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM INITIALIZE-VALUES.
    PERFORM CALCULATE-PAY.
    PERFORM DISPLAY-RESULTS.
    STOP RUN.

INITIALIZE-VALUES.
    MOVE "John Smith" TO WS-WHO.
    MOVE "SAN JOSE, CALIFORNIA" TO WS-WHERE.
    MOVE "TO TEST COBOL PROGRAM" TO WS-WHY.
    MOVE 25 TO WS-RATE.
    MOVE 40 TO WS-HOURS.

CALCULATE-PAY.
    COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY = WS-RATE * WS-HOURS.
    MOVE WS-GROSS-PAY TO WS-GS-PAY-E.

DISPLAY-RESULTS.
    DISPLAY "WHO: " WS-WHO.
    DISPLAY "WHERE: " WS-WHERE.
    DISPLAY "WHY: " WS-WHY.
    DISPLAY "RATE: " WS-RATE.
    DISPLAY "HOURS: " WS-HOURS.
    DISPLAY "GROSS PAY: " WS-GS-PAY-E.
    

